{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28930","headline":"金谷桃花 · 许浑","name":"金谷桃花","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"花在舞楼空，年年依旧红。\n泪光停晓露，愁态倚春风。\n开处妾先死，落时君亦终。\n东流两三片，应在夜泉中。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28930.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28930","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}